From: CloudAndX <cloudandx@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] propagate XCB headers to Vulkan cereal

The Vulkan cereal target includes XCB platform declarations when building the
Linux gfxstream backend, but its public dependency list omits the interface
target that exposes those locked headers.

diff --git a/host/vulkan/cereal/CMakeLists.txt b/host/vulkan/cereal/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/host/vulkan/cereal/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/host/vulkan/cereal/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -37,2 +37,3 @@ target_link_libraries(
     gfxstream_vulkan_headers
+    gfxstream_xcb_headers
     )
